[{"speaker":"","text":"接着，蕾娜将身体靠了过来。","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"我帮她理了理满是汗水的刘海，然后再次温柔地吻了她一下。","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「啾……将臣，啾，啾」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「蕾娜……蕾娜……」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嘻嘻，今天的新婚游戏……回忆起来是不是很棒？」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……说实话，我感觉自己一辈子都不会忘」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「但是」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……什么？」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「和你一同度过的任何一段回忆，我都毕生难忘」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我觉得我应该也是」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「但是……我不在的这三天，你还是会寂寞的吧？」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是啊」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你之前才教过我，要怎么辨认星星……」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"那原本是让远在两地的人忍耐寂寞的办法。","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「可是，一想到要和你……」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……我也是，一想到要和你……」","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们不想分别，哪怕只有片刻。","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"在我们俩必须考虑未来的事情时……","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"},{"speaker":"","text":"这种心情将会变得非常重要。","art":{"background":"a4069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"后日谈"}]